/*
  AppearanceSettings.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0204 · AppearanceSettings (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "AppearanceSettings").
  Every user-facing string the SwiftUI parity of
  features/settings/components/AppearanceSettings.tsx renders resolves here through
  the AppearanceSettingsStrings facade with the web `t(key, default)` English value
  as the fallback. The web keys are preserved VERBATIM (theme.* / achievements.* /
  settings.tours.*); native-only additions (the composed theme-mode + accent
  controls, the ADR-013 freshness chip + offline band, the server-region states,
  the save-failure toast, and the VoiceOver copy) are grouped at the bottom. Folds
  into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; kept
  per-surface so this prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.
*/

